<https://repolex.ai/data/jmespath/jmespath.py/commit/88e68d83c80bd707eb46398d142ad4140347a1eb> <https://repolex.ai/ontology/extracts/gitpython-developers/GitPython/v3.1.46/core/message> "Merge branch 'expression' into develop\n\n* expression:\n  Return a ParsedResult class instead of raw AST node" <https://repolex.ai/data/jmespath/jmespath.py/commit> .
<https://repolex.ai/data/jmespath/jmespath.py/commit/371de51c9ce581e3bc5c8f4be42227d3f96e37af> <https://repolex.ai/ontology/extracts/gitpython-developers/GitPython/v3.1.46/core/message> "Include license file in the generated wheel package\n\nThe wheel package format supports including the license file. This is\ndone using the [metadata] section in the setup.cfg file. For additional\ninformation on this feature, see:\n\nhttps://wheel.readthedocs.io/en/stable/index.html#including-the-license-in-the-generated-wheel-file\n\nDistributing the wheel now complies with the license:\n\n> The above copyright notice and this permission notice shall be\n> included in all copies or substantial portions of the Software." <https://repolex.ai/data/jmespath/jmespath.py/commit> .
