<https://repolex.ai/data/jmespath/jmespath.py/commit/07be6442cd32170b3e0fa6ebf7f384dd2c69156b> <https://repolex.ai/ontology/extracts/gitpython-developers/GitPython/v3.1.46/core/message> "Remove cruft that's no longer needed after pratt-jep-4\n\nThe pratt-jep-4 changed the internal AST of projections.  Several\nof the AST nodes are now no longer needed.  I've also removed any\nof the AST unit tests related to those nodes.  The compliance tests\nhave those covered anyways.\n\nI also removed anything related to generated the lrtable's as we're\nno longer using PLY.\n\nAnd finally, we don't need to pull a dependency on PLY anymore." <https://repolex.ai/data/jmespath/jmespath.py/commit> .
