<https://repolex.ai/data/jmespath/jmespath.py/commit/2aa3ca29aa3ac2d3c5689d9fa537bd8dac8262ff> <https://repolex.ai/ontology/extracts/gitpython-developers/GitPython/v3.1.46/core/message> "Integrate hypothesis testing into jmespath\n\nThese new tests found 2 bugs in the lexer/parser, so this\ncommit also contains the fixes for these bugs.\n\nI've added support for bumping up the max_examples run so I can\nhave travis run these tests for a little longer.  These don't really\nneed to run every python version, so for now I've added longer\nhypothesis runs on py27 on travis.\n\nhypothesis isn't supported on python2.6, so these tests will\nbe skipped when running on py26.\n\nI also had to add a setting option that disables a healthcheck\nthat fails on pypy." <https://repolex.ai/data/jmespath/jmespath.py/commit> .
