<https://repolex.ai/data/jmespath/jmespath.py/commit/887690b4c64cf32e9be2c19d927257e5f661ae08> <https://repolex.ai/ontology/extracts/gitpython-developers/GitPython/v3.1.46/core/message> "Improve lexer/parser error messages\n\nLexer error messages:\n\njmespath.compile('fooasdfasdfasdfasdf.\\\"bar')\"\njmespath.lexer.LexerError: Bad jmespath expression: Bad token '\"bar': starting quote is missing the ending quote:\nfooasdfasdfasdfasdf.\"bar\n                    ^\n\nParser error messages:\n\njmespath.compile('foo]baz')\"\njmespath.parser.ParseError: Invalid jmespath expression: Parse error at column 3 near token \"]\" (RBRACKET) for expression:\n\"foo]baz\"\n    ^" <https://repolex.ai/data/jmespath/jmespath.py/commit> .
